ADF Foods Limited Reports Q2 and H1 FY26 Financials
Standalone Q2 FY26 YoY PAT Growth of 39%
ADF Foods Limited, a leading manufacturer of prepared ethnic
foods, announced Financial Results for the second quarter and half year ended 30th September
2025.
